{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mano.slump.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "真乃 · 唱不出来的那天 · second",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.slump.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.slump.second",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "n01",
    "nodes": {
      "n01": {
        "id": "n01",
        "text": "事务所的灯只开了一盏。她坐在桌边，面前那碗面几乎没有动过。",
        "nextNodeId": "n02"
      },
      "n02": {
        "id": "n02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "制作人先生。今天的事，我想了一路。",
        "nextNodeId": "n03"
      },
      "n03": {
        "id": "n03",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "如果我做不到，早点说会比较好吧。这样大家还能换人。",
        "nextNodeId": "n04"
      },
      "n04": {
        "id": "n04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……我不是在赌气。我是真的这么想。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "把问题拆开：到底是哪一句唱不出来",
            "nextNodeId": "n05a",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "var",
                "key": "mano.slumpApproach",
                "op": "set",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "先休息一天，什么都别想",
            "nextNodeId": "n05b",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "var",
                "key": "mano.slumpApproach",
                "op": "set",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "陪她把今天那段重听一遍",
            "nextNodeId": "n05c",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "var",
                "key": "mano.slumpApproach",
                "op": "set",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "n05a": {
        "id": "n05a",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "哪一句……是第二段最后那句。每次到那里，我就开始想别的。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n05b": {
        "id": "n05b",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "休息。……好。那我明天什么都不做。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n05c": {
        "id": "n05c",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "要听吗。……会很糟糕。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n06": {
        "id": "n06",
        "text": "她终于拿起筷子，吃了一口。面已经凉了。",
        "effects": [
          {
            "kind": "var",
            "key": "mano.slump",
            "op": "set",
            "value": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
